<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU" class="no-js" data-sig="links:grow,buttons:arrow,tilt:1,marquee:1">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Newcastle Concrete Soulutions Pty Ltd — Concrete driveways &amp; finishes, Newcastle &amp; Hunter NSW</title>
<meta name="description" content="Licensed concrete contractor for Newcastle &amp; the Hunter, NSW. Driveways, exposed aggregate, pathways and repairs. Call 0412 705 429 for a firm quote.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Newcastle Concrete Soulutions Pty Ltd — Concrete, Newcastle &amp; Hunter NSW">
<meta property="og:description" content="Licensed concreting — driveways, exposed aggregate, pathways &amp; repairs. Newcastle &amp; Hunter, NSW.">
<meta property="og:image" content="images/newcastle-concrete-cover-1.jpg">
<link rel="icon" href="images/logo.svg">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo+Black:wght@400;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;800;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<script>
document.documentElement.classList.remove('no-js');
document.documentElement.classList.add('js');
</script>
<style>
:root{
  --paper:#F3EFE8; --paper2:#EAE3D7; --ink:#221E19; --muted:#57503F;
  --acc:#963F1F; --acc-deep:#7E3418; --amber:#C08A3E; --amber-ink:#85561C; --line:rgba(34,30,25,.16);
  --slab:#2A2621; --slab-ink:#F3EFE8; --accent:#963F1F; --clay:#D9A566;
  --disp:'Archivo Black','Arial Black',sans-serif; --body:'Inter',sans-serif;
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:var(--body);background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;-webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;overflow-x:hidden}
h1,h2,h3{font-family:var(--disp)}
::selection{background:var(--acc);color:var(--paper)}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
section,header,footer,nav{scroll-margin-top:94px}

/* ---- reveal system: hidden only when JS is on; fully visible without JS ---- */
.rv{will-change:opacity,transform}
.no-js .rv{opacity:1;transform:none;transition:none}
.js .rv{opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px);transition: opacity .45s ease,transform .45s ease}
.js .rv.on{opacity:1;transform:none}
.js .rv.d1{transition-delay:.08s}.js .rv.d2{transition-delay:.16s}.js .rv.d3{transition-delay:.24s}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce){.rv{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important;transition:none!important}}

/* ---- site strip + header ---- */
.strip{background:var(--slab);color:var(--slab-ink);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:9px 40px;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:10px}
.strip b{color:var(--amber);font-weight:800}
.site-head{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;background:rgba(243,239,232,.94);-webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.head-row{max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;padding:15px 40px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px}
.brand img{height:58px;width:auto;object-fit:contain;border-radius:6px}
.brand-name{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:19px;letter-spacing:.03em;line-height:1.05}
.brand-tag{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--acc);text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800;margin-top:3px}
.head-links{display:flex;gap:24px;margin-left:auto;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted)}
.head-links a{transition:color .15s}
.head-links a:hover{color:var(--acc)}
.head-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.btn{display:inline-block;padding:13px 24px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.05em;text-transform:uppercase;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);border-radius:2px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,color .15s,transform .12s}
.btn-acc{background:var(--acc);color:var(--paper);border-color:var(--acc)}
.btn-acc:hover{background:var(--acc-deep);transform:translateY(-1px)}
.btn-ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink)}
.btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--ink);color:var(--paper)}
.btn-sm{padding:9px 16px;font-size:12px}
.btn-tel{border-color:var(--acc);color:var(--acc);background:transparent}
.btn-tel:hover{background:var(--acc);color:var(--paper)}
@media (max-width:1000px){.head-links{display:none}.head-row{justify-content:space-between}.strip{padding:9px 16px}}
@media (max-width:640px){
  .head-row{gap:12px;padding:12px 14px}
  .brand img{height:46px;width:46px}
  .brand-name{font-size:15px}
  .head-cta{gap:6px}
  .head-cta .btn{padding:8px 10px;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.02em}
  .head-cta a[href^="tel:"]{padding:8px 9px;font-size:10px;white-space:nowrap}
  .head-cta .btn-acc{padding:8px 11px;font-size:10px}
  .strip{font-size:10.5px}
}
@media (max-width:480px){
  .head-cta .btn-acc{display:none}
  .brand-tag{font-size:9px}
}

/* ---- hero: real project photo, darkened, with scrim ---- */
.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#1B150F}
.hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(10,11,12,.95) 0%,rgba(10,11,12,.7) 50%,rgba(10,11,12,.3) 100%)}
.hero-scrim{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;background:linear-gradient(100deg,rgba(24,18,13,.95) 0%,rgba(24,18,13,.88) 30%,rgba(24,18,13,.62) 60%,rgba(24,18,13,.34) 100%)}
.hero-3d{display:none;perspective:900px}
.hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:1360px;margin:0 auto;padding:92px 40px 104px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.08fr .92fr;gap:64px;align-items:center}
.hero-copy{position:relative;z-index:2}
.kick{display:inline-block;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--clay);border-bottom:2px solid var(--amber);padding-bottom:5px}
.hero-title{font-size:clamp(42px,6.8vw,88px);line-height:.98;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.022em;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:26px;color:var(--paper)}
.hero-title em{color:var(--clay);font-style:normal}
.hero-title .un{display:block}
.hero-sub{margin-top:24px;font-size:17px;font-weight:500;color:#EBE2D4;max-width:560px}
.hero-ctas{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:30px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.hero-ctas .btn-ghost{border-color:rgba(243,239,232,.55);color:var(--paper)}
.hero-ctas .btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--paper)}
.hero-chips{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:36px}
.chip{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--ink);border:1px solid rgba(34,30,25,.28);background:rgba(243,239,232,.94);padding:9px 14px;border-radius:3px}
.chip b{color:var(--amber-ink)}
/* hero photo stage — clean industrial frame on the dark hero */
.shot-stage{position:relative;z-index:2}
.shot{background:var(--paper);border:2.5px solid var(--ink);box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(12,8,5,.5)}
.shot img{width:100%;height:520px;display:block;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 42%}
.shot-cap{position:static;margin-top:-1px;background:var(--slab);color:var(--slab-ink);padding:13px 16px;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:800}
.shot-cap span{color:var(--amber)}
@media (max-width:1000px){
  .hero-inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;padding:36px 20px 56px;gap:0}
  .hero-title{font-size:clamp(36px,9vw,56px)}
  .hero-sub{font-size:15.5px}
  .shot-stage{display:none}
  .hero-scrim{background:linear-gradient(170deg,rgba(24,18,13,.93) 0%,rgba(24,18,13,.84) 55%,rgba(24,18,13,.7) 100%)}
  .hero-bg img{object-position:center 55%}
}

/* ---- works gallery ---- */
.works{padding:110px 0 96px;background:var(--paper)}
.wrap{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}
.sec-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:26px;margin-bottom:52px}
.sec-idx{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:900;color:var(--acc);letter-spacing:.18em;border:1.5px solid var(--acc);padding:9px 12px}
.sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(27px,3.2vw,44px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.015em}
.sec-head h2 u{text-decoration:none;border-bottom:3px solid var(--amber)}
.lead{color:var(--muted);margin-top:12px;max-width:540px;font-size:15px}
.track{display:flex;gap:26px;overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;padding-bottom:14px;scrollbar-width:thin}
.track::-webkit-scrollbar{height:6px}
.card{flex:0 0 min(520px,86%);scroll-snap-align:start;background:var(--paper)}
.card img{width:100%;height:340px;object-fit:cover;display:block}
.card-cap{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;padding:12px 4px;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.card-cap b{font-size:14.5px}
.card-cap i{font-size:11px;color:var(--acc);font-family:var(--body);font-style:normal;letter-spacing:.12em}
.track-nav{display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:flex-end;margin-top:16px}
.track-btn{width:46px;height:46px;border:1.5px solid var(--ink);background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font-size:17px;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s,color .15s}
.track-btn:hover{background:var(--acc);border-color:var(--acc);color:var(--paper)}
@media (max-width:900px){.card img{height:252px}.works{padding:72px 0 64px}.wrap{padding:0 20px}}

/* ---- trade statement ---- */
.trade{padding:96px 0;background:var(--paper2)}
.trade .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.15fr .85fr;gap:64px;align-items:center}
.trade h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.4vw,46px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.015em;line-height:1.06}
.trade h2 em{color:var(--acc);font-style:normal}
.trade p{margin-top:20px;font-size:15.5px;color:var(--muted);max-width:540px}
.trade-ctas{display:flex;gap:14px;margin-top:28px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tickpt{display:flex;gap:18px;align-items:flex-start}
.tick{width:15px;height:15px;background:var(--acc);transform:rotate(45deg);margin-top:3px;flex-shrink:0}
.tickpt b{display:block;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:16px}
.tickpt span{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;display:block;margin-top:3px}
.pts{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:24px}
@media (max-width:900px){.trade .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:36px}.trade{padding:66px 0}}

/* ---- services ---- */
.svc{padding:110px 0 96px}
.svc-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:64px 1fr 46px;gap:22px;align-items:center;padding:30px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.svc-row:last-child{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.svc-n{font-size:13px;font-weight:900;color:var(--acc);letter-spacing:.1em}
.svc-body h3{font-size:23px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.01em}
.svc-body p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14.5px;margin-top:6px;max-width:620px}
.svc-go{font-size:22px;color:var(--acc);text-align:center;transition:transform .2s}
.svc-go:hover{transform:translate(3px,-3px)}
.svc-row:hover .svc-go{transform:translate(3px,-3px)}
@media (max-width:900px){.svc-row{grid-template-columns:52px 1fr 36px}.svc{padding:72px 0 64px}}

/* ---- process ---- */
.proc{padding:110px 0 96px;background:var(--paper)}
.proc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:34px;margin-top:14px}
.step{position:relative;padding:34px 22px 30px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:var(--paper)}
.step-sn{position:absolute;top:-15px;left:14px;font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:900;font-size:15px;color:var(--acc);background:var(--paper);padding:2px 10px;border:1.5px solid var(--acc)}
.step h3{font-size:19px;font-weight:800;margin-top:22px}
.step p{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:8px}
@media (max-width:900px){.proc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:24px}.proc{padding:72px 0 64px}}
@media (max-width:560px){.proc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}

/* ---- FAQ ---- */
.faq{padding:110px 0 96px;background:var(--paper2)}
.faq-list{max-width:860px;margin-top:16px}
.faq-item{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:14px}
.faq-item summary{font-family:var(--disp);font-weight:800;font-size:17.5px;padding:20px 26px;cursor:pointer;list-style:none}
.faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
.faq-item summary::after{content:"+";color:var(--acc);font-weight:900;font-size:19px;margin-left:auto}
.faq-item[open] summary::after{content:"\2212";color:var(--acc-deep)}
.faq-item .a{padding:16px 26px;border-left:3px solid var(--amber);color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;line-height:1.65}
.faq-item .a a{color:var(--acc);font-weight:800;text-decoration:underline}
@media (max-width:900px){.faq{padding:72px 0 64px}.faq-item summary{padding:16px 20px;font-size:16px}}

/* ---- CTA panel ---- */
.cta-panel{background:var(--slab);color:var(--slab-ink)}
.cta-panel .wrap{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:34px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:88px 40px}
.cta-panel h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4vw,54px);font-weight:900;letter-spacing:-.02em;text-transform:uppercase}
.cta-panel h2 em{color:var(--amber);font-style:normal}
.cta-btns{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.cta-panel .btn-acc{background:var(--acc);color:var(--slab-ink);border-color:var(--acc)}
.cta-panel .btn-ghost{border-color:var(--slab-ink);color:var(--slab-ink)}
.cta-panel .btn-ghost:hover{background:var(--slab-ink);color:var(--slab)}
@media (max-width:900px){.cta-panel .wrap{padding:64px 20px;justify-content:center;flex-direction:column;gap:26px;align-items:flex-start}}

/* ---- footer ---- */
.site-footer{background:var(--paper);border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.site-footer .wrap{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.5fr 1fr 1fr 1fr;gap:44px;padding:74px 40px 46px}
.site-footer h4{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--acc);margin-bottom:16px}
.site-footer a{display:block;font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);padding:5px 0;transition:color .15s}
.site-footer a:hover{color:var(--acc)}
.f-bot{max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;padding:20px 40px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted)}
.f-bot b{color:var(--amber-ink)}
@media (max-width:1000px){.site-footer .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
</style>
<style>/* 3D hero canvas — kept as a hidden layer (LB-3D-HERO marker retained) */#heroCanvas{display:none;perspective:800px}</style>
<noscript><style>.rv,[data-ux]{opacity:1!important;transform:none!important;visibility:visible!important}</style></noscript></head>
<body>

<div class="strip"><span>NSW Contractor Licence <b>145541C</b></span><span>&middot;</span><span>Newcastle &amp; Hunter, NSW</span></div>

<header class="site-head">
  <div class="head-row">
    <a class="brand" href="#top" aria-label="Newcastle Concrete Soulutions home">
      <img src="images/logo.svg" alt="Newcastle Concrete Soulutions Pty Ltd logo" width="58" height="58">
      <span style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;">
        <span class="brand-name">NEWCASTLE CONCRETE<br>SOULUTIONS</span>
        <span class="brand-tag">Concreting &middot; Newcastle &amp; Hunter NSW</span>
      </span>
    </a>
    <nav class="head-links" aria-label="Primary">
      <a href="#work">Work</a><a href="#services">Services</a><a href="#process">Process</a><a href="#faq">FAQ</a>
    </nav>
    <div class="head-cta">
      <a href="tel:+61412705429" class="btn btn-tel btn-sm">0412 705 429</a>
      <a href="#lbq" class="btn btn-acc btn-sm" data-ux="magnetic">Free quote</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<main id="top">

<section class="hero" id="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero-scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <!-- LB-3D-HERO -->
  <div class="hero-3d" aria-hidden="true"><canvas id="heroCanvas" width="16" height="16"></canvas></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <span class="kick">Concreting &middot; Newcastle &amp; Hunter, NSW</span>
      <h1 class="hero-title" data-ux="words">Concrete,<span class="un">poured <em>to</em> <em>stay.</em></span></h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">Driveways, exposed-aggregate finishes, pathways and repairs across Newcastle &amp; the Hunter. Proper prep, clean formwork, firm quotes &mdash; and finishes that still look right twenty years on.</p>
      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#lbq" class="btn btn-acc" data-ux="magnetic">Get a free quote</a>
        <a href="tel:+61412705429" class="btn btn-ghost">Call 0412 705 429</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-chips">
        <span class="chip"><b>30 years</b> on the tools</span>
        <span class="chip">Licence <b>145541C</b></span>
        <span class="chip">Newcastle &amp; Hunter</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <figure class="shot-stage">
      <div class="shot">
        <img src="images/newcastle-concrete-cover-1.jpg" alt="Fresh concrete driveway pour with formwork still in place — Newcastle Concrete Soulutions Pty Ltd">
        <div class="shot-cap"><span>Recent pour</span> &middot; formwork still standing</div>
      </div>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="works" id="work">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-idx rv">01</div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="rv d1">Recent pours, <u>no stock photos.</u></h2>
        <p class="lead rv d2">Photographs from actual Newcastle &amp; Hunter jobs &mdash; formwork still standing, concrete still fresh.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="track rv" id="worksTrack">
      <figure class="card"><img src="images/newcastle-concrete-cover-1.jpg" alt="Fresh concrete driveway pour with formwork still in place" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="card-cap"><b>Driveway pour &mdash; formwork still up</b><i>/ 01</i></figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="card"><img src="images/newcastle-concrete-cover-2.jpg" alt="New-build driveway with fresh textured concrete finish and control joints" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="card-cap"><b>Textured driveway &mdash; new build</b><i>/ 02</i></figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="card"><img src="images/newcastle-concrete-cover-3.jpg" alt="Same new-build driveway at the finishing stage, control joints cut" loading="lazy"><figcaption class="card-cap"><b>Finishing stage &mdash; control joints</b><i>/ 03</i></figcaption></figure>
    </div>
    <div class="track-nav rv d1">
      <button class="track-btn" id="tPrev" aria-label="Previous photos">&#8592;</button>
      <button class="track-btn" id="tNext" aria-label="Next photos">&#8594;</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="trade" id="trade">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>
      <div class="sec-idx rv">02</div>
      <h2 class="rv d1" style="margin-top:16px;">The crew <em>builders book.</em></h2>
      <p class="rv d2">We subcontract directly to builders and construction companies across Newcastle &amp; the Hunter &mdash; your program, our crew, no handballing.</p>
      <div class="trade-ctas rv d3">
        <a href="#lbq" class="btn btn-acc" data-ux="magnetic">Request a subcontract quote</a>
        <a href="tel:+61412705429" class="btn btn-ghost">Call 0412 705 429</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="pts">
      <div class="tickpt rv"><span class="tick"></span><div><b>Builder partnerships</b><span>Driveway and pathway packages slotted into your program, job after job.</span></div></div>
      <div class="tickpt rv d1"><span class="tick"></span><div><b>Construction companies</b><span>Slabs, stage works and civil concrete priced per project or per stage.</span></div></div>
      <div class="tickpt rv d2"><span class="tick"></span><div><b>On your schedule</b><span>We pour when the program says, and we turn up when we say we will.</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="svc" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-idx rv">03</div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="rv d1">What <u>we pour.</u></h2>
        <p class="lead rv d2">From setting out and formwork through to steel, pouring and finishing, the same crew handles every stage — so no detail falls between trades.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-row rv"><span class="svc-n">01</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Driveways</h3><p>Driveways in plain, coloured or exposed aggregate, poured true to grade — tough enough for vehicles and smart enough for kerb appeal.</p></div><span class="svc-go">&#8599;</span></div>
    <div class="svc-row rv d1"><span class="svc-n">02</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Exposed aggregate driveways</h3><p>Decorative concrete finishes engineered to resist wear and retain their appearance over decades.</p></div><span class="svc-go">&#8599;</span></div>
    <div class="svc-row rv d2"><span class="svc-n">03</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Pathways &amp; edging</h3><p>Pathways and edging laid clean and true, bringing the yard together.</p></div><span class="svc-go">&#8599;</span></div>
    <div class="svc-row rv d3"><span class="svc-n">04</span><div class="svc-body"><h3>Repairs &amp; replacements</h3><p>When concrete is cracked or outdated, we inspect it, price it and replace it correctly.</p></div><span class="svc-go">&#8599;</span></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="proc" id="process">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-idx rv">04</div>
      <div>
        <h2 class="rv d1">How a <u>pour runs.</u></h2>
        <p class="lead rv d2">Simple, start to finish.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="proc-grid">
      <div class="step rv"><span class="step-sn">01</span><h3>Tell us the job</h3><p>Dimensions, finish and timing — pictures make it easier. Expect a quick response.</p></div>
      <div class="step rv d1"><span class="step-sn">02</span><h3>Firm quote</h3><p>Measured, priced, written down &mdash; before anything is poured.</p></div>
      <div class="step rv d2"><span class="step-sn">03</span><h3>Prep &amp; pour</h3><p>Ground preparation, steel reinforcement and neat formwork — these are what give concrete its longevity.</p></div>
      <div class="step rv d3"><span class="step-sn">04</span><h3>Finish &amp; cure</h3><p>Delivered to specification, cured to timetable, and the site tidied before handover.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="faq" id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <div class="sec-idx rv">05</div>
      <div><h2 class="rv d1">Common <u>questions.</u></h2></div>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list">
      <details class="faq-item rv"><summary>What area do you work across?</summary><div class="a">Newcastle &amp; surrounds plus the Hunter region, NSW &mdash; driveways, pathways, exposed aggregate, repairs and builder subcontract work.</div></details>
      <details class="faq-item rv d1"><summary>Are you licensed?</summary><div class="a">Yes. Newcastle Concrete Soulutions Pty Ltd holds NSW contractor licence <b>145541C</b>.</div></details>
      <details class="faq-item rv d2"><summary>How long have you been concreting?</summary><div class="a">Around 30 years, almost all of it across Newcastle and the Hunter.</div></details>
      <details class="faq-item rv d3"><summary>How do quotes work?</summary><div class="a">We look at the job &mdash; size, access, finish &mdash; and give you a written price before anything is poured. Call <a href="tel:+61412705429">0412 705 429</a> to line up a time.</div></details>
      <details class="faq-item rv"><summary>Do you pour exposed aggregate?</summary><div class="a">Yes &mdash; exposed-aggregate driveways are a core job, alongside plain, coloured and textured finishes.</div></details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

